<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S DOUBLES SEMIFINALS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S DOUBLES SEMIFINALS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Men's doubles semifinal result at</p>
<p>Wimbledon on Saturday (prefix numbder denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Todd Woodbridge (Australia)/Mark Woodforde (Australia)</p>
<p>beat Wayne Black (Zimbabwe)/Jim Grabb (U.S.) 7-6 (7-3) 6-4 3-6</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Played on Friday:</p>
<p>2-Jacco Eltingh (Netherlands)/Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands)</p>
<p>beat 13-Martin Damm (Czech Republic)/Pavel Vizner (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-2 6-2 6-4</p>
</text>
